main script 

list of functions 
1) clsys -  
2) trajectory - where we want the drone to go 
3) controllerParams - position and attitude controller gains
4) fbl - feedback linearization controller 
5) controlAllocation - 
    - take in the virtual control; v = [Fx;Fy;Fz;Mx;My;Mz];
    - outputs the desired force of each rotor in x,y,z in the local rotor reference
6) rotorParams
    - takes in te 
7) virtualControl
8) plant


